The following are properties of an operator.

-> Commutativity
   The order of the operands for this operator doesn't influence final result.
   E.g., + *
   Not E.g., -  /

-> Associativity
   In the execution stream the order of this operator doesn't influence final
   result
   (2 + 3) + 5 == 2 + (3 + 5)

   Perf counters show associativity hence we can locally accumulate them in a 
   thread then do a global merge.

   
